# Build-context hygiene: tests, caches, local envs, keys and VCS metadata never ship in images.
**/tests/
**/test/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.benchmarks/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/.coveragerc
**/htmlcov/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/*.md
# Helper-image build inputs are built separately, not used by the worker runtime
helper-image/
